  "managementDiscussion": "In fiscal year FY2026, Hindustan Unilever recorded revenue of \u20b90.73 lakh crore, growing 8.0% year-on-year, driven by continued momentum across Beauty & Personal Care, Home Care. Net income stood at \u20b90.12 lakh crore with a net margin of 17.0% and a return on equity of 21.0%. Operating cash flow remained robust at \u20b90.15 lakh crore, supporting capital expenditure of \u20b90.01 lakh crore and a free cash flow of \u20b90.13 lakh crore. The company maintains a measured capital structure with net debt-to-equity of 0.06x. Management continues to invest in digital and AI capabilities, expects sustained volume-led growth and disciplined cost control, and remains committed to value-accretive capital allocation and sustainable returns for shareholders.",
